<overview>
<p>The Free Worlds League Military has long fielded some of the largest infantry formations in the Inner Sphere, with regiments numbering nearly 1,800 soldiers compared to roughly 750 in the Combine and just over 1,000 in the Federated Suns. Foot infantry platoons form the garrison backbone of the League's provincial militaries, assigned to hold ground on worlds that BattleMech forces cannot permanently occupy. Quality varies with provincial investment, but even modest foot platoons benefit from the FWLM's tradition of equipping infantry with reliable, standardized kit. Equipped with laser rifles that offer superior range and armor penetration compared to ballistic weapons, these platoons field one of the most effective personal arms available to conventional infantry, though the weapons are significantly more expensive and require soldiers to carry additional power packs. These marines are trained to fight equally well in zero-gravity and conventional ground environments, conducting shipboard security, boarding actions, and combat in vacuum or pressurized hull conditions.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
The Intek Laser Rifle is the standard laser long arm of the FWLM. Intro date based on production date of Intek Laser Rifle.
</notes>

